{"seq":2,"slug":"data-profiling-discovery","title":"数据剖析与发现技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations/data-profiling-discovery","wordCount":1461,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据剖析与发现技术\">数据剖析与发现技术</h1><p>拿到一个从未见过的数据集，第一反应不应该是&quot;写一堆测试规则&quot;，而是&quot;先弄清楚这些数据长什么样&quot;。数据剖析（Data Profiling）就是这个&quot;弄清楚&quot;的过程——它通过统计分析自动揭示数据的结构特征、值分布、异常模式，为后续的规则定义提供事实依据而非猜测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据剖析的三个关键能力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>统计发现</strong>：通过自动化统计分析揭示数据的真实特征，消除&quot;我以为数据长这样&quot;的假设</li>\n<li><strong>规则推导</strong>：将剖析结果转化为可执行的测试规则草稿，提供系统性而非随机的规则生成起点</li>\n<li><strong>基线管理</strong>：建立数据特征的动态基线，区分正常演变与异常退化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"剖析的三个层次\">剖析的三个层次</h2><p>数据剖析按分析粒度分为三层，每层回答不同的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>分析对象</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>输出物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结构剖析</td>\n<td>表/文件</td>\n<td>有哪些列？类型是什么？行数多少？</td>\n<td>Schema 快照、文件格式报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列级剖析</td>\n<td>单列</td>\n<td>值的分布如何？有多少空值？基数多大？</td>\n<td>统计摘要、直方图、模式频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系剖析</td>\n<td>列间/表间</td>\n<td>哪些列存在函数依赖？外键关系是否成立？</td>\n<td>依赖图、引用完整性报告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"列级统计分析的核心指标\">列级统计分析的核心指标</h2><p>列级剖析是最常用也最有价值的分析层次。对于每一列，标准的剖析会计算以下指标：</p>\n<p><strong>数值型列</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>统计摘要</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>skewness</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>kurtosis</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{统计摘要} = \\{\\min, Q_1, \\text{median}, Q_3, \\max, \\mu, \\sigma, \\text{skewness}, \\text{kurtosis}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">统计摘要</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">skewness</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kurtosis</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中偏度（skewness）和峰度（kurtosis）帮助识别分布形态：偏度远离 0 意味着值集中在一侧，高峰度意味着存在极端值。这些统计量直接转化为测试阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pandas as pd&#10;&#10;def profile_numeric_column(series: pd.Series) -&gt; dict:&#10;    stats = {&#10;        &quot;count&quot;: len(series),&#10;        &quot;null_rate&quot;: series.isna().mean(),&#10;        &quot;mean&quot;: series.mean(),&#10;        &quot;std&quot;: series.std(),&#10;        &quot;min&quot;: series.min(),&#10;        &quot;p25&quot;: series.quantile(0.25),&#10;        &quot;median&quot;: series.median(),&#10;        &quot;p75&quot;: series.quantile(0.75),&#10;        &quot;max&quot;: series.max(),&#10;        &quot;distinct_count&quot;: series.nunique(),&#10;        &quot;zero_rate&quot;: (series == 0).mean(),&#10;    }&#10;    iqr = stats[&quot;p75&quot;] - stats[&quot;p25&quot;]&#10;    stats[&quot;lower_fence&quot;] = stats[&quot;p25&quot;] - 1.5 * iqr&#10;    stats[&quot;upper_fence&quot;] = stats[&quot;p75&quot;] + 1.5 * iqr&#10;    stats[&quot;outlier_rate&quot;] = (&#10;        (series &lt; stats[&quot;lower_fence&quot;]) | (series &gt; stats[&quot;upper_fence&quot;])&#10;    ).mean()&#10;    return stats\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> profile_numeric_column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(series: pd.Series) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(series),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"null_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: series.isna().mean(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"mean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: series.mean(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"std\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: series.std(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: series.min(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"p25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: series.quantile(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"median\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: series.median(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"p75\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: series.quantile(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: series.max(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"distinct_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: series.nunique(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"zero_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (series </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).mean(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    iqr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p75\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stats[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lower_fence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iqr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stats[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"upper_fence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p75\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iqr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stats[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"outlier_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        (series </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lower_fence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (series </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"upper_fence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ).mean()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>字符串列</strong>的剖析重点不同——关注模式（Pattern）发现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>长度分布：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>len</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>len</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>avg</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>len</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(\\text{len}), \\max(\\text{len}), \\text{avg}(\\text{len})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">len</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">len</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">avg</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">len</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>模式频率：将值映射到模式（如 <code>&quot;2026-07-18&quot;</code> → <code>&quot;NNNN-NN-NN&quot;</code>），统计 Top-K 模式</li>\n<li>特殊字符比例：空白、非 ASCII、控制字符的出现频率</li>\n<li>疑似分类变量识别：当基数（distinct count）远小于总行数时</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自动规则推导-从剖析到测试\">自动规则推导：从剖析到测试</h2><p>剖析结果最大的工程价值在于自动生成初始测试规则。这个过程的核心逻辑是&quot;用历史数据的特征作为未来数据的期望&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[统计剖析]&#10;    B --&gt; C{特征提取}&#10;    C --&gt; D[空值率 &lt; 1%]&#10;    C --&gt; E[值域 0-1000]&#10;    C --&gt; F[唯一性 100%]&#10;    C --&gt; G[模式 NNNN-NN-NN]&#10;    D --&gt; H[生成 Expectation]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[Expectation Suite]&#10;    I --&gt; J[人工审核与调整]&#10;    J --&gt; K[生产规则集]\">graph LR\n    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[统计剖析]\n    B --&gt; C{特征提取}\n    C --&gt; D[空值率 &lt; 1%]\n    C --&gt; E[值域 0-1000]\n    C --&gt; F[唯一性 100%]\n    C --&gt; G[模式 NNNN-NN-NN]\n    D --&gt; H[生成 Expectation]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[Expectation Suite]\n    I --&gt; J[人工审核与调整]\n    J --&gt; K[生产规则集]</pre><p><strong>从剖析到规则的推导策略</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测特征</th>\n<th>推导规则</th>\n<th>置信度</th>\n<th>需人工确认</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空值率 = 0%</td>\n<td><code>not_null</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>否——除非是新字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基数 &lt; 20 且稳定</td>\n<td><code>accepted_values</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是——需确认枚举是否完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有值匹配同一模式</td>\n<td><code>match_regex</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值域在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\mu - 4\\sigma, \\mu + 4\\sigma]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><code>be_between</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是——需确认业务边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列值全局唯一</td>\n<td><code>be_unique</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>否——除非允许更新覆写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两列相关系数 &gt; 0.95</td>\n<td>标记为冗余/派生</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键原则：<strong>自动推导生成草稿，人工审核产出规则</strong>。直接将剖析结果不加审核地投入生产是危险的——它会把数据当前的偶然特征固化为永久约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量剖析与基线漂移检测\">增量剖析与基线漂移检测</h2><p>初始剖析是一次性的，但数据是持续变化的。增量剖析解决&quot;数据特征随时间的正常演变&quot;与&quot;异常退化&quot;的区分问题。</p>\n<p><strong>滑动窗口基线</strong>：维护最近 N 批次的统计摘要，用当前批次与窗口内的分布进行比较。当偏差超过阈值时触发告警：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>drift_score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mtext>current</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>current</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{drift\\_score}(X_{\\text{current}}, X_{\\text{baseline}}) = D_{KL}(P_{\\text{current}} \\| P_{\\text{baseline}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">drift_score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">current</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">current</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>KL 散度（Kullback-Leibler Divergence）量化两个分布的差异。对于离散分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>x</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{KL}(P \\| Q) = \\sum_{x} P(x) \\log \\frac{P(x)}{Q(x)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.677em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际工程中，常用 Jensen-Shannon Divergence（对称版本）或 Population Stability Index（PSI）替代，因为 KL 散度在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(x) = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时未定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大规模数据的剖析优化\">大规模数据的剖析优化</h2><p>当数据量达到十亿行级别时，精确计算所有统计量不再经济。常用的优化策略：</p>\n<p><strong>采样剖析</strong>：对大表使用分层抽样，样本量由期望的置信区间决定。对于估计比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的 95% 置信区间精度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3.84</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>0.96</mn><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\frac{z^2 \\cdot p(1-p)}{d^2} \\approx \\frac{3.84 \\cdot 0.25}{d^2} = \\frac{0.96}{d^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3.84</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.96</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>精度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span> 需要约 9600 条样本——对于大表来说这是极小的采样比。</p>\n<p><strong>近似算法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基数估计：HyperLogLog（误差 &lt; 2%，内存 O(1)）</li>\n<li>分位数估计：t-digest 或 KLL sketch（可合并、支持分布式）</li>\n<li>频率估计：Count-Min Sketch</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些 sketch 数据结构可以在分布式环境中先分片计算再合并，适合 Spark/Flink 等分布式引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"剖析工具的选择\">剖析工具的选择</h2><p>GX Cloud（Great Expectations）内置了 Data Asset Profiling 功能，在数据资产创建时自动进行结构与统计剖析，并将结果用于推荐 Expectation 参数。Soda 的 <code>discover</code> 命令执行类似的列级分析。对于已经在 dbt 生态中的团队，<code>dbt-profiler</code> 包可以将剖析结果物化为模型。</p>\n<p>无论选择哪个工具，剖析的输出都应该服务于同一个目标：为 <a href=\"quality-dimensions-metrics\">质量维度</a> 中定义的每个维度生成可执行的测试规则。工具的详细对比和使用方法见本 hub 第二章的三篇工具文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据剖析是连接&quot;未知数据集&quot;和&quot;可执行测试规则&quot;的桥梁。三层剖析（结构→列级→关系）逐步深入地揭示数据特征，自动规则推导将发现转化为行动，增量剖析确保规则不会因数据的正常演变而大量误报。核心原则始终是：剖析生成草稿，人工产出规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据剖析与发现技术","id":"数据剖析与发现技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"剖析的三个层次","id":"剖析的三个层次"},{"level":2,"text":"列级统计分析的核心指标","id":"列级统计分析的核心指标"},{"level":2,"text":"自动规则推导：从剖析到测试","id":"自动规则推导-从剖析到测试"},{"level":2,"text":"增量剖析与基线漂移检测","id":"增量剖析与基线漂移检测"},{"level":2,"text":"大规模数据的剖析优化","id":"大规模数据的剖析优化"},{"level":2,"text":"剖析工具的选择","id":"剖析工具的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据质量维度与度量体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations/quality-dimensions-metrics"},"next":{"title":"质量架构与设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations/quality-architecture-patterns"}}